      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Warm wool bags remain one of the season's most sought-after pieces this fall and winter, and FENDI has dressed its icons in playful, craft-inspired winter finery this week. The house's signature Baguette and Peekaboo top-handle bags are wrapped in plush shearling outer shells, trimmed with creamy wool edging that recalls a fresh layer of winter snow, conjuring a soft and cozy cold-weather mood.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
