      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Camel ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This group is crafted from Merino shearling, supple and warm to the touch, dyed in one of the season's most iconic shades — camel — for an air of quiet luxury and effortless polish. The standout detail is a fluffy ivory lambswool trim circling the edge of each bag, echoing the lining within like a sweet layer of milk foam atop a cup of milk tea.",
